msgstr "此挂载的语言版本（``[[site.mounts.editions]]``）；留空时，挂载按其配置的语言构建一次。"

#: ../../reference/configuration.rst:1181
msgid "Mount language editions ([[site.mounts.editions]])"
msgstr "挂载语言版本 ([[site.mounts.editions]])"

#: ../../reference/configuration.rst:1192
msgid ""
"Language code for this edition (such as ``\"en\"`` or ``\"zh_CN\"``), "
"unique within the mount."
msgstr "此版本的语言代码（如 ``\"en\"`` 或 ``\"zh_CN\"``），在挂载内唯一。"

#: ../../reference/configuration.rst:1196
msgid ""
"Portable relative subdirectory beneath the mount's ``output`` folder; "
"``\"\"`` places this edition at the mount's root. Unique within the mount."
msgstr "挂载 ``output`` 文件夹下的便携式相对子目录；``\"\"`` 将此版本置于挂载根目录下。在挂载内唯一。"

#: ../../reference/configuration.rst:1200
msgid ""
"Optional separate translated project folder relative to the site root; "
"when empty, the mount's ``source`` is built with gettext catalogs for "
"``language``."
msgstr "相对于站点根目录的可选独立翻译项目文件夹；留空时，挂载的 ``source`` 将结合 ``language`` 的 gettext 目录进行构建。"

#: ../../reference/configuration.rst:1204
msgid ""
"Extra ``key=value`` overrides applied after the mount's own ``overrides``."
msgstr "在挂载自身的 ``overrides`` 之后应用的额外 ``key=value`` 覆盖项。"

#: ../../reference/configuration.rst:1206
msgid "Shared site assets ([[site.assets]])"
msgstr "共享站点资源 ([[site.assets]])"

#: ../../reference/configuration.rst:1217
msgid ""
"File or folder relative to the site configuration folder, copied once "
"after all mounts build."
msgstr "相对于站点配置文件夹的文件或文件夹，在所有挂载构建完成后统一复制一次。"

#: ../../reference/configuration.rst:1221
msgid ""
"Portable relative destination folder inside the assembled site; ``\"\"`` "
"copies to the website root."
msgstr "组装站点内的便携相对目标文件夹；``\"\"`` 表示复制到网站根目录。"

#: ../../reference/configuration.rst:1261
msgid "Trust"
msgstr "信任"

#: ../../reference/configuration.rst:1264
msgid ""
"``guidedog build --untrusted`` builds a project whose sources we did not "
"write. Raw content is left out, nothing is fetched, and no build plugin "
"runs. The project cannot widen what the build reads. ``include_roots`` "
"and ``pdf_preamble`` are not used. Files and folders that lead outside "
"the source folder (``html_logo``, ``html_favicon``, ``pdf_logo``, "
"``mathjax_config_path``, ``html_static_path``, ``html_extra_path``, "
"``templates_path``, ``locale_dirs``, ``pdf_font_paths``, "
"``autodoc_source_paths``, ``odin_autoapi_dirs``, ``rust_autoapi_crates``) "
"are left out. No Typst package is downloaded. Each dropped setting is a "
"``build.untrusted`` warning. This is a capability policy, not a process "
"sandbox. See :doc:`cli`."
msgstr ""
"``guidedog build --untrusted`` "
"用于构建源文件并非由我们编写的项目。原始内容会被略去，不获取任何内容，也不运行任何构建插件。项目无法扩大构建可读取的范围。``include_roots`` "
"和 ``pdf_preamble`` "
"不会生效。指向源目录之外的文件和文件夹（``html_logo``、``html_favicon``、``pdf_logo``、``mathjax_config_path``、``html_static_path``、``html_extra_path``、``templates_path``、``locale_dirs``、``pdf_font_paths``、``autodoc_source_paths``、``odin_autoapi_dirs``、``rust_autoapi_crates``）会被略去。不下载任何 "
"Typst 包。每个被舍弃的设置都会产生一条 ``build.untrusted`` 警告。这是一种能力策略，而不是进程沙箱。参见 "
":doc:`cli`。"

#: ../../reference/formats.rst:1
msgid "Readers, renderers, and builders"
msgstr "读取器、渲染器与构建器"

#: ../../reference/formats.rst:4
msgid ""
"A reader understands a source language. A renderer writes one document "
"tree. A builder coordinates a project and publishes its output. These are "
"different responsibilities."
msgstr "读取器理解源语言；渲染器输出一棵文档树；构建器协调项目并发布输出。这是不同职责。"

#: ../../reference/formats.rst:8
msgid "Source routes"
msgstr "源文件处理路线"

#: ../../reference/formats.rst:12
msgid "Input"
msgstr "输入"

#: ../../reference/formats.rst:13
msgid "Reader"
msgstr "读取器"

#: ../../reference/formats.rst:14
msgid "Route"
msgstr "路线"

#: ../../reference/formats.rst:15
msgid "RST in a project"
msgstr "项目中的 RST"

#: ../../reference/formats.rst:16
msgid "RST plus the built-in Sphinx layer"
msgstr "RST 与内置的 Sphinx 层"

#: ../../reference/formats.rst:17
