msgstr "将项目图生成 HTML、Typst/PDF、文本或翻译清单。"

#: ../../reference/formats.rst:18
msgid "Markdown in a project"
msgstr "项目中的 Markdown"

#: ../../reference/formats.rst:19
msgid "MyST-compatible Markdown layer"
msgstr "兼容 MyST 的 Markdown 层"

#: ../../reference/formats.rst:20
msgid "The same project graph and builders."
msgstr "使用同一项目图和构建器。"

#: ../../reference/formats.rst:21
msgid "``convert file.md``"
msgstr "``convert file.md``"

#: ../../reference/formats.rst:22
msgid "Plain CommonMark"
msgstr "纯 CommonMark"

#: ../../reference/formats.rst:23
msgid "One document to HTML or Typst/PDF."
msgstr "将一份文档生成 HTML 或 Typst/PDF。"

#: ../../reference/formats.rst:24
msgid "``convert file.typ``"
msgstr "``convert file.typ``"

#: ../../reference/formats.rst:25
msgid "Native Typst adapter"
msgstr "原生 Typst 适配器"

#: ../../reference/formats.rst:26
msgid "Typst compilation outside Guidedoc's semantic tree."
msgstr "在 Guidedoc 语义树之外编译 Typst。"

#: ../../reference/formats.rst:28
msgid ""
"Each reader and renderer is its own crate, and ``guidedoc-defaults`` "
"registers them. Three crates read: ``guidedoc-rst`` (reStructuredText), "
"``guidedoc-commonmark`` (CommonMark 0.31.2 and MyST), and "
"``guidedoc-sphinx`` (the Sphinx directives, roles and domains on both). "
"Three crates render: ``guidedoc-html``, ``guidedoc-typst``, and "
"``guidedoc-text``. A program can register only the ones it needs; see "
":doc:`../howto/install`."
msgstr ""
"每个读取器和渲染器都是独立的 crate，由 ``guidedoc-defaults`` 统一注册。负责读取的有三个 "
"crate：``guidedoc-rst`` （reStructuredText）、``guidedoc-commonmark`` "
"（CommonMark 0.31.2 和 MyST），以及 ``guidedoc-sphinx`` （在两者之上提供 Sphinx "
"指令、角色和域）。负责渲染的也有三个：``guidedoc-html``、``guidedoc-typst`` 和 "
"``guidedoc-text``。程序可以只注册自己需要的部分，参见 :doc:`../howto/install`。"

